src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.82df02ee37a770d8:
This 2021 Alfa Romeo Giulia came to our workshop in Belgrade for a scheduled service. We went beyond a simple oil change, checking all the routine service items and servicing the automatic transmission as well.

What we did:

- replaced the spark plugs;
- changed the engine oil;
- replaced the oil filter;
- replaced the air filter;
- replaced the cabin filter;
- replaced the complete automatic transmission sump pan;
- changed the fluid in the ZF 8HP automatic transmission.

We paid particular attention to the transmission. On **ZF 8HP** automatics, it is important to monitor the condition of the fluid and sump pan and keep up with servicing. Timely maintenance costs far less than a transmission repair.

src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.d3eb4aa1c1f43fad:
Alfa Romeo Giulia 2021. godište stigla je kod nas u Beograd na redovan servis. Nismo se zadržali samo na zameni ulja: proverili smo sav potrošni materijal i ujedno servisirali automatski menjač.

Šta smo uradili:

- zamenili svećice;
- zamenili motorno ulje;
- zamenili filter ulja;
- zamenili filter vazduha;
- zamenili filter kabine;
- zamenili kompletan karter automatskog menjača;
- zamenili ulje u automatskom menjaču ZF 8HP.

Posebnu pažnju posvetili smo menjaču. Kod automatskih menjača **ZF 8HP** važno je pratiti stanje ulja i kartera i ne odlagati servis: pravovremeno održavanje menjača košta znatno manje od njegove popravke.

src/content/works/audi-q7/index.md.18aab3e7dd14dff5:
**2008 Audi Q7. Extensive repairs at our workshop in Belgrade, Serbia.**

This 2008 Audi Q7 came to us with a long list of faults. Both the suspension and the engine needed serious attention.

The work included:

- replacing the suspension arms;
- replacing the brake discs and pads;
- repairs in the engine valley between the cylinder banks;
- resealing the intake system;
- replacing the EGR pipe;
- a routine service with an oil and filter change.

There was also a persistent engine oil leak. During a previous service, the sump drain plug had been fitted incorrectly, leaving oil constantly dripping from the engine. We fixed the issue and put everything right.

The first-generation Audi Q7 needs expert maintenance, especially as these cars get older and cover higher mileages. The key is to identify and fix the underlying cause of a fault, rather than simply fit a new part.

src/content/works/audi-q7/index.md.7e9979363243faf7:
**Audi Q7 2008. godište. Obimni radovi u našem auto-servisu u Beogradu, Srbija.**

U naš servis stigao je Audi Q7 iz 2008. godine sa podužim spiskom kvarova. Bili su potrebni ozbiljniji radovi i na trapu i na motoru.

Šta je urađeno:

- zamena ramena vešanja;
- zamena kočionih diskova i pločica;
- radovi u prostoru između dva reda cilindara motora;
- zamena zaptivki usisnog sistema;
- zamena EGR cevi;
- mali servis sa zamenom ulja i filtera.

Poseban problem bilo je stalno curenje motornog ulja. Prilikom prethodnog servisa čep za ispuštanje ulja nije pravilno postavljen, pa je ulje neprestano kapalo iz motora. Otklonili smo problem i sve doveli u red.

Audi Q7 prve generacije zahteva stručno održavanje, naročito kada je reč o starijim primercima sa velikom kilometražom. Važno je utvrditi zašto je došlo do kvara i otkloniti uzrok, a ne samo ugraditi novi deo.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.2cc8578dcbfe39fb:
This Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 came to our workshop in Belgrade for an interim service.

Work carried out:

- engine oil change;
- oil filter replacement;
- engine air filter replacement;
- cabin filter replacement;
- replacement of all brake pads;
- brake system inspection and servicing.

A closer look at the brakes. Brake pads are a key safety component and need regular checks. Whenever we replace the pads, we also inspect the **discs, calipers and guide pins**: if any of these are seized or worn, the car may brake unevenly.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.67f38a3afe6a6110:
Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 stigao je u naš auto-servis u Beogradu na mali servis.

Uradili smo:

- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu filtera ulja;
- zamenu filtera vazduha motora;
- zamenu filtera kabine;
- zamenu svih kočionih pločica;
- servis i proveru kočionog sistema.

Posebnu pažnju posvetili smo kočnicama. Kočione pločice su jedan od ključnih elemenata bezbednosti i treba ih redovno kontrolisati. Pri zameni pločica uvek proveravamo i **diskove, kočiona klešta i vođice**: ako je nešto od toga zapeklo ili istrošeno, automobil neće ravnomerno kočiti.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.b9cf9d76e5d2f2e6:
MINI Cooper SD sa dizel motorom **2.0 B47 od 170 KS** stigao je u naš servis u Beogradu na kompletno održavanje.

Uradili smo:

- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu svih filtera;
- zamenu filtera goriva;
- zamenu ulja u osmostepenom automatskom menjaču Aisin;
- kompjutersku dijagnostiku motora i elektronskih sistema;
- proveru usisnog sistema.

Filter goriva na dizel motoru treba menjati najmanje jednom na **20.000 km**: time se štiti sistem goriva i obezbeđuje stabilan rad motora.

Prilikom provere usisa pronašli smo velike naslage prljavštine: vrtložne klapne bile su prekrivene debelim slojem čađi i gareži. Predložili smo vlasniku čišćenje, on je pristao, pa smo temeljno očistili ceo usis.

Dizel motor B47 u vozilima BMW i MINI, automatski menjač Aisin i usisni sistem zahtevaju redovno održavanje: pravovremenu zamenu ulja i filtera, kao i povremenu proveru stanja usisa. Tako se skupe popravke mogu izbeći na duže vreme.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.eb818690a6acc7d5:
A MINI Cooper SD with a **170 hp 2.0 B47 diesel engine** came into our workshop in Belgrade for a comprehensive service.

We carried out:

- an engine oil change;
- replacement of all filters;
- a fuel filter replacement;
- an oil change for the 8-speed Aisin automatic transmission;
- computer diagnostics of the engine and electronic systems;
- an intake system inspection.

On a diesel, the fuel filter should be replaced at least every **20,000 km** to protect the fuel system and keep the engine running smoothly.

The intake inspection revealed heavy contamination: the swirl flaps were coated in a thick layer of soot and carbon deposits. We recommended cleaning the intake, the owner agreed, and we thoroughly cleaned the entire system.

Regular maintenance is key to looking after the B47 diesel used in BMW and MINI models, the Aisin automatic transmission and the intake system. Change the oil and filters on schedule and keep an eye on intake deposits to help keep costly repairs at bay.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.6294334f2953ea9f:
U naš autoservis u Beogradu stigao je automobil zbog **vibracija pri kočenju**: kada vozač pritisne papučicu kočnice, automobil počne da se trese.

Počeli smo od provere balansa točkova. To je najčešći uzrok ovakvih vibracija i najlakše ga je isključiti. Balans je bio u redu, pa smo nastavili sa proverom kočionog sistema.

Na prvi pogled, diskovi i pločice bili su u dobrom stanju, bez očiglednih znakova veće istrošenosti. Detaljnom proverom utvrdili smo da je **levi kočioni disk deformisan**. Upravo on je izazivao vibracije.

Pokazali smo problem klijentu i dogovorili popravku. Šta smo uradili:

- dijagnostiku kočionog sistema;
- proveru i balansiranje točkova;
- utvrđivanje deformacije levog kočionog diska;
- zamenu kočionih diskova;
- zamenu kočionih pločica;
- ponovnu proveru balansa točkova;
- probnu vožnju nakon popravke.

Vibracije pri kočenju su nakon toga potpuno nestale. Automobil smo proverili i predali vlasniku.

Disk može da izgleda sasvim normalno, a da ipak bude kriv, jer se takva deformacija ne može uočiti golim okom. Zato, ako primetite podrhtavanje volana, papučice kočnice ili karoserije pri kočenju, nemojte odlagati dijagnostiku.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.81e40452e4fe310f:
A car came into our workshop in Belgrade with a complaint of **vibration under braking**: whenever the driver pressed the brake pedal, the car would shake.

We started by checking the wheel balance. Wheel imbalance is a common cause of vibration and one of the easiest to rule out. The balance was fine, so we moved on to the braking system.

At first glance, the discs and pads looked fine, with no obvious signs of heavy wear. A closer inspection revealed that **the left brake disc was warped**. This was causing the vibration.

We showed the customer the problem and got approval for the repair. Here is what we did:

- inspected the braking system;
- checked and balanced the wheels;
- identified warping in the left brake disc;
- replaced the brake discs;
- replaced the brake pads;
- rechecked the wheel balance;
- carried out a road test after the repair.

The vibration under braking was completely gone. After the final checks, we returned the car to its owner.

A brake disc can look perfectly fine and still be warped. This kind of distortion is not something you can spot by eye. So if you notice the steering wheel shaking, the brake pedal pulsing or the car vibrating under braking, it is best not to put off having it checked.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.6b859a55f04924cb:
Peugeot 308 iz 2024. godine sa dizel motorom **1.5 BlueHDi** stigao je u naš ruski auto-servis u Beogradu na veliki servis. Uradili smo kompletan servis:

- zamenu zupčastog kaiša;
- zamenu vodene pumpe;
- zamenu antifriza;
- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu filtera;
- proveru i servisiranje svih pratećih komponenti.

Motor 1.5 BlueHDi ima jednu specifičnost na koju vredi posebno obratiti pažnju: lanac koji povezuje bregaste osovine. Na ranijim verzijama ovog motora ugrađivan je lanac širine **7 mm**. Vremenom se isteže, a u najgorem slučaju može da pukne i izazove teško oštećenje motora.

Prilikom servisiranja ovih motora preporučuje se ugradnja ojačanog lanca širine **8 mm**, zajedno sa kućištem bregastih osovina i samim bregastim osovinama. Peugeot 308 iz 2023. i 2024. godine već fabrički ima lanac širine 8 mm.

Zato pri velikom servisu ne treba proveravati samo zupčasti kaiš, već i lanac bregastih osovina, kao i sve poznate slabe tačke konkretnog motora.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.b7a94b37c175bbe8:
This 2024 Peugeot 308 with a **1.5 BlueHDi** diesel engine came to our Russian-speaking garage in Belgrade for a major service. We carried out the full service, including:

- timing belt replacement;
- water pump replacement;
- coolant replacement;
- engine oil change;
- filter replacement;
- inspection and servicing of all associated components.

The 1.5 BlueHDi has one particular issue worth knowing about: the camshaft chain. Early versions of this engine were fitted with a **7 mm** chain. Over time, it can stretch or, in the worst case, break and cause catastrophic engine damage.

When servicing these engines, the recommendation is to fit the upgraded **8 mm** chain, along with the camshaft carrier and the camshafts themselves. Peugeot 308 models from 2023–2024 already have the 8 mm chain fitted from the factory.

So a major service should involve checking not just the timing belt, but also the camshaft chain, as well as any other known issues specific to the engine.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.47d83d16f88bd82c:
Seat Leon sa **190 000 km** na satu stigao je u naš ruski auto-servis u Beogradu na redovno održavanje, odnosno veliki servis.

Na ovoj kilometraži najbolje je odjednom servisirati sve ključne sklopove, pa smo uradili:

- zamenu seta zupčastog kaiša;
- zamenu vodene pumpe;
- zamenu antifriza;
- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu svih potrebnih filtera;
- zamenu zadnjih amortizera;
- zamenu ulja u DSG DQ250 menjaču.

Za vozila marki Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda i Audi veliki servis je jedan od najvažnijih koraka u održavanju. Pravovremena zamena zupčastog kaiša, vodene pumpe, radnih tečnosti i potrošnih delova sprečava znatno skuplje kvarove kasnije.

Posebnu pažnju zaslužuje **DQ250**. To je šestostepeni menjač sa dvostrukim kvačilom u uljnom kupatilu. Ulje u njemu mora da se menja u propisanim intervalima, jer od toga zavise njegov pouzdan rad i dug vek.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.e31be9d53aa44d77:
This Seat Leon came to our Russian-speaking garage in Belgrade with **190,000 km** on the clock for a major scheduled service.

At this mileage, it makes sense to service the key components together, so we carried out:

- timing belt kit replacement;
- water pump replacement;
- coolant replacement;
- engine oil change;
- replacement of all required filters;
- rear shock absorber replacement;
- DSG DQ250 transmission oil change.

For Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda and Audi vehicles, a major service is a key maintenance milestone. Replacing the timing belt, water pump, fluids and service items on time helps prevent much more expensive problems down the line.

A separate note on the **DQ250**: this is a six-speed dual-clutch transmission with wet clutches. Its transmission oil needs to be changed at the specified intervals, as regular oil changes are essential to keeping it reliable.
